/span></td><td><span><span>최소값:4, 최대값:4</span></span></td></tr><tr><td><span><span>bndex_xcrdnt</span></span></td><td><span><span>number</span></span></td><td><span><span><strong></strong></span></span></td><td><span><span>Bounding Box X Coordinate</span></span></td><td><span><span>바운딩박스 X 좌표<br/> 최소값:1, 최대값:99999</span></span></td></tr><tr><td><span><span>bndex_ycrdnt</span></span></td><td><span><span>number</span></span></td><td><span><span><strong></strong></span></span></td><td><span><span>Bounding Box Y Coordinate</span></span></td><td><span><span>바운딩박스 Y 좌표<br/> 최소값:1, 최대값:99999</span></span></td></tr><tr><td><span><span>bndex_width</span></span></td><td><span><span>number</span></span></td><td><span><span><strong></strong></span></span></td><td><span><span>Bounding Box Width</span></span></td><td><span><span>바운딩박스 넓이<br/> 최소값:1, 최대값:99999</span></span></td></tr><tr><td><span><span>bndex_hg</span></span></td><td><span><span>number</span></span></td><td><span><span><strong></strong></span></span></td><td><span><span>Bounding Box Height</span></span></td><td><span><span>바운딩박스 높이<br/> 최소값:1, 최대값:99999</span></span></td></tr><tr><td><span><span>annotations[].polygon</span></span></td><td><span><span>list</span></span></td><td><span><span></span></span></td><td><span><span>폴리곤 정보</span></span></td><td><span><span>폴리곤 정보</span></span></td></tr><tr><td><span><span>pyn</span></span></td><td><span><span>number</span></span></td><td><span><span><strong></strong></span></span></td><td><span><span>POLYGON</span></span></td><td><span><span>폴리곤 순번<br/> 최소값:1, 최대값:1000</span></span></td></tr><tr><td><span><span>pyn_xcrdnt</span></span></td><td><span><span>number</span></span></td><td><span><span><strong></strong></span></span></td><td><span><span>POLYGON X Coordinate</span></span></td><td><span><span>폴리곤 X 좌표<br/> 최소값:1, 최대값:99999</span></span></td></tr><tr><td><span><span>pyn_ycrdnt</span></span></td><td><span><span>number</span></span></td><td><span><span><strong></strong>